### Sales Report

#### [MODIFY] [SummaryCards.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Azlan/OneDrive/Documents/Point-of-Sale/Front-End/src/pages/SalesReport/components/SummaryCards.tsx)

- Ubah `grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4` → horizontal snap carousel pada mobile (`< 768px`)
- Setiap card: `min-w-[260px]`, `scroll-snap-align: start`
- Gunakan `useIsMobile` hook yang sudah ada
- Desktop layout tetap grid 4-col (tidak berubah)
- Value text: `text-3xl` → `text-2xl` on mobile agar tidak overflow

#### [MODIFY] [DetailTabs.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Azlan/OneDrive/Documents/Point-of-Sale/Front-End/src/pages/SalesReport/components/DetailTabs.tsx)

- Tab bar: tambah `overflow-x-auto` + `scrollbar-hide` agar tab bisa scroll horizontal di mobile
- **Products tab**: Ubah table → vertical card list pada mobile
  - Setiap card: rank medal + nama produk + qty + revenue + margin
  - Desktop tetap table
- **Cashier tab**: Sama — table → card list pada mobile
- **Payment tab**: Sudah card-based, tidak berubah

#### [MODIFY] [index.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Azlan/OneDrive/Documents/Point-of-Sale/Front-End/src/pages/SalesReport/index.tsx)

- **Cost Breakdown section** (line 150-188): `grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4` → horizontal scroll snap pada mobile
- **Transaction List table** (line 213-257): Tambah mobile card view (hidden on md+), hide table on mobile
  - Setiap card: waktu + items + total + payment badge
  - Klik card → expand detail (sudah ada logic `expandedTx`)
- **Date filter pills**: Tambah `overflow-x-auto` + snap scroll saat layar sempit
- **Pagination buttons**: Perbesar touch target ke `min-h-[44px]`

