### Transaction History

#### [MODIFY] [OwnerHistory.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Azlan/OneDrive/Documents/Point-of-Sale/Front-End/src/pages/TransactionHistory/OwnerHistory.tsx)

- **Summary cards** (line 196-236): Ubah ke horizontal snap carousel pada mobile (sudah grid, tapi 4 card bisa overflow)
- **Filter section** (line 264-328): 
  - Wrap dalam collapsible accordion pada mobile (default collapsed, tombol "Filter" untuk buka)
  - Ini mengurangi visual noise drastis — filter panjang menyulitkan mobile
  - Status pills + payment select: `overflow-x-auto` horizontal scroll
  - Export CSV button: pindah ke header row (sejajar dengan judul)
- **Pending void banner** (line 239-262): Compact — hide detail list by default, show count + "Lihat" button
- **Mobile card list** (line 387-410): Sudah ada! Polish:
  - Tambah border-t color fix (line 404: `dark:border-stone-800` → use conditional class)
  - Perbesar touch area tombol "Lihat Detail"  
  - Tambah payment method icon (Cash/QRIS/Card)
- **Pagination** (line 414-433): Perbesar button touch target

#### [MODIFY] [CashierHistory.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Azlan/OneDrive/Documents/Point-of-Sale/Front-End/src/pages/TransactionHistory/CashierHistory.tsx)

- **Filter bar**: Wrap dalam collapsible on mobile (sama seperti OwnerHistory)
- **Card list**: Sudah card-based — polish touch targets & spacing
- **Pagination**: Perbesar touch target
- Minor: Header text `text-3xl` → `text-2xl` on mobile

