## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
```bash
# TypeScript compile check — must pass with zero errors
npx tsc --noEmit --pretty

# Dev server — visual verification
npm run dev
```

### Manual Verification (Browser DevTools Mobile Mode)
- [ ] **Dashboard**: Stock alert icon muncul, klik → dropdown. Carousel stats smooth. Chart renders. Desktop layout untouched.
- [ ] **Sales Report**: Summary cards scroll horizontal. DetailTabs products show as cards on mobile. Cost breakdown scrollable. Transaction list expandable.
- [ ] **Owner History**: Filter collapsible. Summary carousel. Mobile cards tappable. Pagination buttons ≥ 44px.
- [ ] **Cashier History**: Filter collapsible. Cards tappable. Sort buttons work.
- [ ] **POS**: Search sticky. Product add buttons ≥ 44px. MobileCart works (existing).
- [ ] **Dark mode**: Semua komponen baru konsisten `#111111` bg + `#f59e0b` accent.
- [ ] **No horizontal scroll** pada body (kecuali carousel yang disengaja).
- [ ] **Navigasi**: Semua route tetap berfungsi.
- [ ] **Cart flow**: Tambah/hapus/edit item, checkout, quick pay — semua tetap jalan.
